{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KpKDAq72xSMFX1sqDoC68z","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"number\": 474,\n  \"title\": \"[REQUEST] add option to select() to return unprocessed keys\",\n  \"body\": \"NOTE: If a feature could be implemented in a third-party library, then it is unlikely to be accepted as part of the core library.\\n\\nNOTE: Feature requests will not be considered unless first approved in discussions (https://github.com/textualize/rich/discussions)\\n\\nHave you checked the issues for a similar suggestions?\\n**Yes. Found nothing on \\\"filter\\\"**\\n\\n**How would you improve Rich?**\\n\\nI would like to implement filtering select()'s options by typing substring from keyboard.\\n\\nBy adding option to select() to return unprocessed keys (now they are swallowed) and wrapping select() with custom code.\\n\\n**What problem does it solve for you?**\\n\\nI like to filter long option lists fast - from keyboard not by pressing Up/Down/PageUp/PageDown.\\n\\nMVP code and screencast attached.\\n\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f358aa64-fd01-4e4d-9903-7729067bea11\\n\\n[select_with_filter.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32518291/select_with_filter.py)\\n\\n[select_with_filter_test.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32518295/select_with_filter_test.py)\",\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-22T12:45:15Z\",\n  \"labels\": [\n    \"Needs triage\"\n  ]\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d4511e3f-7d33-4638-a759-10b55f4111b4","uuid":"3ec18c91-8dea-4821-9c3f-205870cbcfdc","timestamp":"2026-10-26T04:55:54.708Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"number\": 474,\n  \"title\": \"[REQUEST] add option to select() to return unprocessed keys\",\n  \"body\": \"NOTE: If a feature could be implemented in a third-party library, then it is unlikely to be accepted as part of the core library.\\n\\nNOTE: Feature requests will not be considered unless first approved in discussions (https://github.com/textualize/rich/discussions)\\n\\nHave you checked the issues for a similar suggestions?\\n**Yes. Found nothing on \\\"filter\\\"**\\n\\n**How would you improve Rich?**\\n\\nI would like to implement filtering select()'s options by typing substring from keyboard.\\n\\nBy adding option to select() to return unprocessed keys (now they are swallowed) and wrapping select() with custom code.\\n\\n**What problem does it solve for you?**\\n\\nI like to filter long option lists fast - from keyboard not by pressing Up/Down/PageUp/PageDown.\\n\\nMVP code and screencast attached.\\n\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f358aa64-fd01-4e4d-9903-7729067bea11\\n\\n[select_with_filter.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32518291/select_with_filter.py)\\n\\n[select_with_filter_test.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32518295/select_with_filter_test.py)\",\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-22T12:45:15Z\",\n  \"labels\": [\n    \"Needs triage\"\n  ]\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KpKDAq72xSMFX1sqDoC68z","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
